From: Xianglong Kong <xkong@anaconda.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Nov 2026 12:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Emit a license manifest for the bundled UI dependencies

AI assistant generated patch.

The recipe builds the llama-server web UI from source with npm instead of
downloading upstream's prebuilt bundle. Vite's build.license writes
.vite/license.md with the license text of every dependency bundled into the
UI; the build script installs it as a license file of the llama.cpp package.
---
 tools/ui/vite.config.ts | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/ui/vite.config.ts b/tools/ui/vite.config.ts
index 233ba74..241adcb 100644
--- a/tools/ui/vite.config.ts
+++ b/tools/ui/vite.config.ts
@@ -32,7 +32,9 @@ export default defineConfig(({ mode }) => {
 		build: {
 			assetsInlineLimit: 32000,
 			chunkSizeWarningLimit: 3072,
-			minify: true
+			minify: true,
+			// Anaconda: write .vite/license.md listing the licenses of every bundled dependency
+			license: true
 		},
 
 		plugins: [
